sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant O as Order service
    participant L as Event log
    participant P as Product service
    participant Y as Payment service

    C->>O: POST /orders  (Idempotency-Key, payment_token)
    Note over O: validate; refuse anything<br/>that is not a tok_... token
    O->>L: append OrderPlaced (v1)
    O->>P: POST /reservations  (order id, items)
    Note over P: all lines or none,<br/>idempotent per order id
    P-->>O: 201 reserved, with names and prices
    O->>L: append StockReserved (v2), total worked out
    O->>Y: POST /charges  (order id, total, token)
    Note over Y: one charge per order id,<br/>asking twice never charges twice
    Y-->>O: 201 approved, reference
    O->>L: append PaymentCaptured (v3)
    O-->>C: 201 Created, status confirmed
